  m_text: 'Welcome to Viso Game! These Terms and Conditions outline the rules and
    regulations for using the BarberMe app and services. By accessing or using our
    app, you agree to be bound by these terms. If you do not agree, please do not
    use our services.


    1. Definitions

    "BarberMe" refers to the platform,
    app, and services provided by [Your Company Name].

    "User" refers to any
    individual who accesses the app, whether as a customer or a barber.

    "Barber"
    refers to the independent contractors providing barbering services through BarberMe.

    "Customer"
    refers to individuals booking services through BarberMe.


    2. Use of Services

    You
    must be at least 18 years old to use BarberMe.

    By using the app, you agree
    to provide accurate and up-to-date information during registration and booking.

    You
    are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account information.

    

    3.
    Booking and Payment

    Booking Process: Customers can browse barbers, view
    their availability, and book services directly through the app.

    Payment:
    All payments are securely processed through the app via Square or other trusted
    payment gateways.

    Cancellations:Customers may cancel appointments 24hr
    before the booking without penalty.

    Cancellations after the allowed timeframe
    may incur a fee.

    4. Responsibilities

    For Barbers:

    Barbers are
    independent contractors and solely responsible for providing services to customers.

    Barbers
    must comply with local licensing and health regulations.

    For Customers:

    Customers
    are responsible for providing accurate information for appointments (e.g., location,
    time).

    BarberMe is not liable for the quality of services provided by barbers.

    5.
    Prohibited Conduct

    Users agree not to:

    Use BarberMe for unlawful
    purposes.

    Provide false information during registration or booking.

    Harass,
    threaten, or harm other users (customers or barbers).

    BarberMe reserves
    the right to terminate accounts violating these terms.

    6. Liability Disclaimer

    BarberMe
    acts as a platform connecting customers and barbers. We are not liable for the
    actions, omissions, or performance of individual barbers.

    BarberMe does
    not guarantee the availability, quality, or suitability of any barber.

    7.
    Intellectual Property

    All content, logos, and materials on BarberMe are
    the intellectual property of [Your Company Name].

    Users may not copy, reproduce,
    or distribute any content without prior written consent.

    8. Termination

    BarberMe
    reserves the right to suspend or terminate any user account at our sole discretion,
    including but not limited to violations of these terms.

    9. Dispute Resolution

    Any
    disputes between customers and barbers must be resolved directly between the
    parties.

    BarberMe may assist as a neutral mediator but is not obligated
    to intervene in disputes.

    10. Changes to Terms

    BarberMe may update
    these Terms and Conditions periodically. Any changes will be posted, and continued
    use of the app signifies acceptance of the revised terms.

    11. Contact Us

    For
    questions or concerns about these Terms and Conditions, please contact us:

    Email:
    support@barberme.com'
