  m_Text: "VISO Hunt is a weekly AR (Augmented Reality) event where players use GPS
    and their phone\u2019s camera to explore real-world locations and find hidden
    virtual eggs,\LVISO Hunt is not just a game\u2014it\u2019s a weekly Augmented
    Reality (AR) adventure that brings the thrill of exploration into the real world.
    Every week, new virtual eggs are hidden across real-world locations, waiting
    for you to find them. Armed with your phone\u2019s GPS and camera, you\u2019ll
    set out on a journey where the digital and physical worlds collide."
